{"version":1,"key":"article:65","content":{"id":65,"title":"如何调试 React 源码","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"30c8a6a1-b4c7-4086-8b84-b0068bbaf635","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 Vite 创建 React 项目，并且在 WebStorm 中调试 React 源码，效果如下："}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e432b0ac-5f5a-46b9-bb8b-23075e0cb74b.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e432b0ac-5f5a-46b9-bb8b-23075e0cb74b.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"81f2ff22-27e2-443e-a359-5fffdfceee52","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"44a82d28-48c5-4483-a062-238dda041586","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以直接调试源码，而不只是打包后的产物。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"6f9c52cc-6dc4-4183-a00d-2140ea09b585","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"构建 React 源码"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c7041f39-7785-4d4e-ab65-7e5a2322e411","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了做到能够直接调试源码，而不是压缩、混肴的产物，我们需要自己构建 React 源码，并且生成 sourcemap 文件。"}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"8920a9b2-2cae-45d6-becb-1e106c6c480a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"86dfc48b-c2bf-4c9d-9a6c-0407f4ed01b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sourcemap（源映射）是一个文件，它提供了一种将压缩、合并或经过其他转换后的代码（如在生产环境中使用的代码）映射回原始源代码的方式。当 JavaScript 代码经过构建工具（如 Webpack、Rollup 等）处理后，代码可能会被压缩、丑化（变量名缩短等操作）或者合并成一个文件，这使得调试变得困难，因为调试工具显示的是转换后的代码，而不是开发人员编写的原始代码。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8f2d6d7d-d5ef-4767-8ff4-72da6962631d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下载"},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/facebook/react","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"6a1760f6-36d7-4600-815b-ddc335ca9f78","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"源码"}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Shell","uuid":"edd981a0-88d2-4b83-a302-6868bff1989c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"02a90ad4-e66c-4742-89b7-a7beb12d6fbb","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"git clone git@github.com:facebook/react.git","collabId":"0af71ca8-03e0-488c-b626-4ed0119a99e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c64206ac-b2ab-4184-a57d-04a6f313491b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于 React 最新的构建结果和之前不同，和找到的参考资料不一样，因此需要 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"reset"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 到之前的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行构建"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Shell","uuid":"003a4479-b266-490b-b95a-41d3a079a427","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c622f5c1-eec4-4f27-bd3e-126f7830dd5e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"git reset --hard 80f3d88190c07c2da11b5cac58a44c3b90fbc296","collabId":"239f8979-67ef-4acc-b585-4943118ae82e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d690d91c-ea93-4b28-a253-d3a562aedfad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"安装依赖"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Shell","uuid":"82b2f84f-070a-431e-b1f7-c20fa3908b23","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1b81ba90-370b-48ec-b268-1490a3ca7e65","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"npm install","collabId":"6fd363de-c95a-4a29-911d-4684e77c15a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b5482ae-5208-4999-aa07-a47c5bf7686e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于 React 构建脚本依赖于 Java，因此需要确保 Java 环境已准备就绪"}]},{"type":"tabs","tauContract":"0256f72bf503014a7ea32d073aa02da06da7e88c98797870e4d49fa627404693","collabId":"2f468c85-3e72-4ba3-b1c8-765c0d0f9caa","children":[{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"2d02ddc8-95c5-4e71-8c9c-a7f2d9b3a53c","title":"Windows","tauContract":"fcfba932818e04e88c2c071bc4f973b1244251a453f417037be7051a453b8f66","collabId":"de9105d5-930d-41bf-81fa-0e14e3f55afe","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"46e8b6b4-ebac-496e-9402-fde862b075a8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"前往 "},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.oracle.com/cn/java/technologies/downloads/#jdk23-windows","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"e15f5754-f38e-442a-923a-c4c3f5381c24","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Oracle 官网"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"下载"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5edb6669-7bc5-46e2-8373-f4582f46349d.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-h